{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "If it's all right with you, sir.": "",
  "Hiya, I'm Saori!": "",
  "Oh, I wasn't expecting such enthusiasm.\nEh, oh well. Come take a seat.": "",
  "Hm? I wasn't expecting such enthusiasm.\nEh, oh well. Come take a seat.": "",
  "Don't mind if I do.": "",
  "...And so, as the young blood in the company,\nI was called on to make a sacrifice for the greater good.": "",
  "...And so, as the greenest guy in the company,\nI was called on to make a sacrifice for the greater good.": "",
  "A sacrifice? They're working you to the bone!\nIt's a shame how much some places impose on their workers.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I suppose every industry\nhas its share of problems...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(She's totally checked out. Not that I blame her.\nI'm not especially interested in this sob story, either.)</color>": "",
  "But you'll persevere in the end.\nI just know it!": "",
  "But you'll persevere in the end,\nI just know it!": "",
  "Oh! You can tell?": "",
  "You can tell?": "",
  "Of course. I get the feeling you're super reliable,\nlike you'll do whatever needs to be done!": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(She's just making things up...)</color>": "",
  "A feeling, huh?\nThat just means you don't know for sure!": "",
  "No, no, no, she can see how valuable I really am!\nNow she just has to convince my boss!": "",
  "No, no! She can see how valuable I really am!\nNow she just has to convince my boss!": "",
  "Hehehe!": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hm, I suppose anything goes so long as it's a compliment.\nMaybe I really <font_kind=yakuza_italic>can</font_kind> do this.)</color>": "",
  "Sorry to interrupt the fun. You've been\nrequested by another customer, Sumire-san.": "",
  "Sorry to interrupt the fun...\nSumire-san? You've been requested by another customer.": "",
  "Ah, apologies.\nYou'll have to excuse me.": "",
  "Ah... Apologies.\nYou'll have to excuse me.": "",
  "Well, that's how the professional world is.\nIf you want to climb the ladder, you have to be persistent.": "",
  "Well, that's just how the professional world is.\nIf you want to climb the ladder, you have to be persistent.": "",
  "Yes, precisely!": "",
  "Have you ever experienced\nsomething like that?": "",
  "What about you?\nDo you know what that's like?": "",
  "Huh!? I, ummm...": "",
  "Huh!? I, umm...": "",
  "Who's imposing now?": "",
  "Wait, you mean <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind>?\nWhat's wrong with that question!?": "",
  "Everything's wrong!\nThe poor girl's about to faint from the pressure!": "",
  "Hahaha! Yeah, you can't just\nspring that on me!": "",
  "Hahaha!\nYeah, you can't just spring that on me!": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Phew, you have to think fast\nif you want to succeed as a hostess...)</color>": "",
  "Did you fall asleep?": "",
  "Of course I didn't!\nMy mind just... wandered off!": "",
  "Objection. You're simply rephrasing\nthe same conclusion.": "",
  "Objection!?\nAm I on trial now?": "",
  "\"Objection\"?\nAm I on trial!?": "",
  "Hahaha! You two would make\na great comedy duo!": "",
  "Hahaha!\nYou two would make a great comedy duo!": "",
  "You'd make a great lawyer, Saori-chan!\nHey, maybe I'll hire you as a consultant!": "",
  "Saori-chan, you'd make a great lawyer!\nMaybe I'll hire you as a consultant!": "",
  "I may just take you up on that\nif you're not careful.": "",
  "Have I mentioned how much I love your tie?": "",
  "I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>love</font_kind> your tie. It's so stylish!": "",
  "What, this old thing? I bought it on a whim\nwhile I was in Italy for business.": "",
  "You have great fashion sense. Not many\nJapanese men could pull off that look.": "",
  "You have great fashion sense.\nNot many Japanese men could pull off that look.": "",
  "So true!\nI can't look away!": "",
  "Wow, I didn't realize you had such a good eye!\nMaybe I'll check that brand out myself someday.": "",
  "Hahaha! Just warning you,\nthey're not cheap!": "",
  "Hahaha!\nJust warning you, they're not cheap!": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Those businessmen finally went home.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I was so focused on talking to them\nthat I couldn't focus on the investigation...)</color>": "",
  "I'm so sorry about that.\nYou were covering for me that whole time.": "",
  "Don't worry about it. I'm used to paying\nattention to my surroundings.": "",
  "Oh, no... Don't worry about it.\nI'm used to having an eye for details.": "",
  "You really have what it takes,\nSaori-san... Way more than me.": "",
  "You really are a natural hostess.\nWay better than me...": "",
  "I don't know, you seem to be far better adjusted.\nHow long have you been working here?": "",
  "Hmmm, maybe six months?\nAt least I'm better now than I was back then.": "",
  "Hmmm, maybe six months?\nBut at least I'm better now than I used to be.": "",
  "I was the worst girl in the club, without a doubt!\nOne time a customer even yelled at me.": "",
  "I was definitely the worst girl in the club!\nOne time, a customer even yelled at me.": "",
  "I remember it like it was yesterday,\nand I'm always so scared that it'll happen again...": "",
  "I still remember it super clearly to this day,\nand I worry it'll happen again all the time...": "",
  "It's okay. We all have down days\nat work every so often.": "",
  "Don't let it bother you.\nWe all have our off days.": "",
  "About that customer, um... \nWell, after he left the club that day, he... died.": "",
  "It's just... That particular customer...\nAfter he left the club that day, he died.": "",
  "You probably heard about it when it happened.\nHe got drunk, got in a fight, then died from his injuries.": "",
  "Didn't you hear? He got drunk,\ngot in a fight, then he died in the hospital.": "",
  "He was apparently pretty important, too.\nInvolved in researching this new drug called AD-9.": "",
  "He was apparently pretty important, too.\nSome bigwig on that new drug, AD-9.": "",
  "You mean Shono-san from the ADDC!?": "",
  "Huh? Shono...?": "",
  "Oh yeah! He was there, too! \nThat's the guy who was drinking with Hashiki-san.": "",
  "Oh yeah, he was there, too!\nThat's the guy who was drinking with Hashiki-san.": "",
  "Right, Hashiki-san!\nHe's the one who died.": "",
  "Right, right. Hashiki-san!\nHe's the one who died.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That was such a careless mistake!\nI need to think about every word I say!)</color>": "",
  "Wait, you knew him?": "",
  "Wait, what?\nYou mean you knew him?": "",
  "Oh, um... yes.\nIt was all over the news.": "",
  "You mean Hashiki-san from the ADDC!?": "",
  "Yeah, that's the guy!\nYou knew him?": "",
  "Right, him.\nSo, you know about it?": "",
  "The case was all over the news, yes.\nI read quite a lot about his death.": "",
  "The case was all over the news, yes.\nI read articles about it too.": "",
  "You mean Hoshino-san!?": "",
  "Huh? Who's Hoshino?\nDid he die, too?": "",
  "Huh? Hoshino?\nThat wasn't it. Is he dead, too?": "",
  "I was talking about a man named Hashiki.\nHe used to work at the ADDC.": "",
  "Oh, right.\nSorry, that's my mistake.": "",
  "Oh, is that right?\nSorry, that's my mistake.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Why did I bring up Hoshino-kun?\nThis is too important to mess up...)</color>": "",
  "I poured the drinks Hashiki-san got drunk off of...\nand it was my carelessness that made him upset.": "",
  "That night, I poured the drinks that got Hashiki-san drunk...\nand it was my carelessness that upset him.": "",
  "I can't help but feel responsible for him\ngetting in the fight that killed him...": "",
  "I can't help but feel responsible that he\ngot into the fight that killed him...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So Mika-san was the one serving Hashiki-san.)</color>": "",
  "My sales numbers aren't so good, either.\nI'm kinda worried that they're gonna fire me.": "",
  "My sales numbers aren't that great, either,\nso I'm kinda worried they're gonna fire me.": "",
  "I know I should do more to boost my numbers,\nbut I always think back to Hashiki-san...": "",
  "About that, Mika-san.": "",
  "Actually, Mika-san...\nAbout that whole thing...": "",
  "Mika-san! Saori-san!\nYou've got a customer!": "",
  "Be right there!": "",
  "Ah, right!": "",
  "Sorry, that got kinda dark, huh.": "",
  "Sorry, didn't mean to get weird.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I need to hear more of what Mika-san has to say.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It didn't sound like a very good experience for her, though.\nI could upset her more if I pry too much.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What should I do...?)</color>": "",
  "Saori-san? You good?": "",
  "Oh, sorry!\nI'm heading over now!": "",
  "Oh, sorry! I'll be right out!": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I need to make her trust me somehow!)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hm, his glass is empty!)</color>": "",
  "Um, would you like another drink?": "",
  "Huh? Well that's not a bad idea.\nLemme see here...": "",
  "Huh? Oh, good idea.\nLemme see here...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Wait, I should let Mika handle this!)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Eyes up, Mika!)</color>": "",
  "Um, you're running low.\nHow 'bout another drink?": "",
  "O-Oh! You're nearly empty here.\nHow 'bout another drink?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Phew, it worked.)</color>": "",
  "Huh? Drained it already?": "",
  "Hm? Oh! Do you want another drink!?": "",
  "Hm? Oh!\nDo you want another drink!?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Phew...)</color>": "",
  "Why don't you splurge\non something fancy?": "",
  "How about something\nfancy this time?": "",
  "Wish I could, but the wallet's\nkinda light this month...": "",
  "Awww, really?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This is my chance.\nTime to step in!)</color>": "",
  "I'm kinda thirsty... ❤": "",
  "I'm kinda thirsty myself... ❤": "",
  "Yeah, me too!": "",
  "Me too, me too!": "",
  "C'mon! Do it for us?": "",
  "C'mooon. Do it for us?": "",
  "All right!\nGimme your finest booze!": "",
  "All right!\nGimme a bottle of your finest!": "",
  "Yayyy! You're the best!": "",
  "Yayyy!\nYou're the best!": "",
  "Fresh bottle, coming right up!": "",
  "One fresh bottle, please! ❤": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I'm just acting... I'm just acting...)</color>": "",
  "Hey, don't be like that.\nYou're here to have fun, aren't you?": "",
  "She's right. Though I can think of something\neven more fun than this...": "",
  "She's right! Though I can think of something\neven more fun than this...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It's all for the case, it's all for the case...)</color>": "",
  "You're incredible, Saori-san!\nI've never seen numbers that high before!": "",
  "Saori-san, thank you so much!\nI've never seen numbers that high before!": "",
  "Don't thank me.\nThat was all you, Mika-san.": "",
  "Oh no?\nBut that was all you, Mika-san.": "",
  "Hey, let's go grab some drinks, my treat!\nI wanna pay you back for tonight!": "",
  "Hey, let's grab some drinks after work, my treat!\nI owe you big time for this!": "",
  "Oh, I couldn't...": "",
  "Huh? I mean...": "",
  "Actually, I know just the spot. Wanna go there?\nI can't wait to learn more about you, Mika-san!": "",
  "Actually, I know just the spot. Shall we?\nI'd love to hear more about you, Mika-san!": "",
  "Totally down!\nWe just gotta hang in 'til our shift's over!": "",
  "Okay! We just gotta hang in there\n'til our shift's over!": "",
  "Hello, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Hey, any luck?": "",
  "Hey. Any luck over there?": "",
  "Yes. I made friends with the girl\nwho served Hashiki six months ago.": "",
  "Yes. I made friends with the girl who\nserved Hashiki's table six months ago.": "",
  "We're gonna bounce and go\nto Tender in a few.": "",
  "We're gonna bounce over to\nTender in a few.": "",
  "Perfect.\nWait, did you just say \"bounce\"?": "",
  "Perfect! Nice job.\nWait, did you just say \"bounce\"?": "",
  "Forget that.\nWhere are you?": "",
  "Where are you now, Yagami-san?": "",
  "At my office.": "",
  "A lot happened after I dropped\nyou off at the club.": "",
  "After I dropped you off there...\nA lot happened.": "",
  "Care to elaborate?": "",
  "A lot?": "",
  "Well... maybe later.": "",
  "Yeah, uh... a lot.": "",
  "Hello? Hoshino-kun?": "",
  "Saori-san made it in,\nthanks to you.": "",
  "Got a job at the Queen Rouge and everything.": "",
  "Got a job at the Queen Rouge.": "",
  "Great. I knew her beauty\nwas nothing to sneeze at!": "",
  "Great. I knew her beauty\nwould shine through!": "",
  "Thanks for taking her around, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Thanks for taking her, Yagami-san.": "",
  "By the way,\nwhat's the plan for tonight?": "",
  "So what's the plan for tonight?": "",
  "We wait for Saori-san to call us.": "",
  "We wait for Saori-san to call.": "",
  "Not much to do but wait 'til then.\nI'm gonna go kill time around town.": "",
  "Not much we can do until then.\nI'm gonna go kill time around town.": "",
  "Be careful out there.": "",
  "I understand.\nBe careful out there.": "",
  "Yeah, will do.": "",
  "(Guess I'll wander a bit.)": "",
  "(Still nothing from Saori-san. What next?)": "",
  "(...Stomach's grumbling.\nThe food stalls at Theater Square sound good.)": "",
  "There you are, know-it-all asshole!": "",
  "You again? I thought you'd\nhave given up by now.": "",
  "You again?\nI thought you'd have given up by now.": "",
  "After what you did to me and the Keihin?\nNot once, but twice!?": "",
  "I'm never backin' down!": "",
  "Sorry, but you reap what you sow.": "",
  "You reap what you sow.": "",
  "Huh? The hell're you talkin' about?\nQuit showing off with your fancy words n' shit!": "",
  "Sow? The hell're you talkin' about?\nYou know-it-alls and your fuckin' metaphors!": "",
  "...Seriously?": "",
  "Sakakiba!": "",
  "Kasaiii.\nI'm hungry!": "",
  "This man is Kaito Sakakiba,\none of the Keihin Four!": "",
  "This man is Kaito Sakakiba, one of the Keihin Four!\nAnd he's gonna beat you down!": "",
  "Him? You let him in?": "",
  "...Really? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Him</font_kind>?": "",
  "Hey, Kasai. You're buyin' me food\nif I take this guy down, yeah?": "",
  "Hey, hey, Kasai. If I take this guy out,\nthat means you're buyin' dinner, right?": "",
  "You better believe it! Steak, ramen, pizza...\nWhatever you want, big guy!": "",
  "You better believe it! Steak, ramen, pizza...\nWhatever you want!": "",
  "I hope you're not lyin'.\nAnd... that mean I get dessert, too?": "",
  "You serious!?\nAnd... that mean I get dessert, too?": "",
  "Sure, sure!\nCake, pudding, anything!": "",
  "Cake, pudding, whatever you want!": "",
  "Does, uh...\nDoes curry count as dessert?": "",
  "Does, um...\nDoes curry count as dessert?": "",
  "Literally anything you want, as much of it\nas you want! Just beat his ass!": "",
  "Anything you want, and as much of it\nas you can eat!": "",
  "C'mon, you can't let him\njust talk you into...": "",
  "F... F-F...": "",
  "Foooooood!": "",
  "Hrgh! ": "",
  "Ugh!": "",
  "Geez, this guy's built\nlike a ton of bricks.": "",
  "Geez, this guy's built like\na ton of bricks.": "",
  "Hahahaha! You see that!?\nThere's no gettin' through his flabby exterior!": "",
  "Hahahaha! Throw all the punches you want,\nthere's no gettin' through his flab!": "",
  "Now go, Sakakiba!\nSmash this bitch!": "",
  "Hmmm?": "",
  "What're you spacin' out for!?\nGet him!": "",
  "Hey, what're you spacin' out for!?\nGet him!": "",
  "...I'm hungry.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Don't mind if I do.": "งั้นก็ไม่ขัดละกัน",
  "Hehehe!": "เฮะเฮะ!",
  "Be right there!": "เดี๋ยวไปเลยครับ!",
  "Yeah, me too!": "เออ ฉันก็เหมือนกัน!",
  "Me too, me too!": "หนูด้วย หนูด้วย!",
  "Care to elaborate?": "อธิบายเพิ่มหน่อยได้ไหม?",
  "Be careful out there.": "ระวังตัวด้วยล่ะ",
  "Yeah, will do.": "ได้ เดี๋ยวจะลองอ่านดู",
  "...Seriously?": "...จริงดิ?",
  "Ugh!": "อุ๊ย!",
  "Hmmm?": "หืม?"
 }
}
